{"seq":3,"slug":"refund-reversal-proration","title":"退款退货的费用冲销与按比例分摊：部分退、跨期退与费用回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/fee-calculation-charge-engine/refund-reversal-proration","wordCount":3022,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"退款退货的费用冲销与按比例分摊-部分退-跨期退与费用回收\">退款退货的费用冲销与按比例分摊：部分退、跨期退与费用回收</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-退款是-记一笔反向分录-不是-删一笔费用\">核心概念：退款是「记一笔反向分录」，不是「删一笔费用」</h2><p>一笔订单全额退款后，如果计费系统把当初那笔佣金分录删掉，账面确实干净了——但审计轨迹断了，已发给商家的对账单与系统当前数据不再一致，期末也没法解释&quot;这个月佣金为什么比上月少&quot;。更麻烦的是部分退款：客户退了三件中的一件，佣金该退多少？退款里包含的运费、优惠券分摊、跨境税费又该怎么拆？</p>\n<p>因此计费引擎把退款建模成<strong>冲销</strong>（reversal）：针对原始费用分录，生成一条金额为负、通过 <code>reverses_entry_id</code> 指向原分录的<strong>反向分录</strong>，原分录不动，冲销分录带上自己的 <code>source_event_id</code>（退款流水号）与 <code>rule_version</code>。任意时刻&quot;该订单分录总和 = 当前应计费用&quot;，这与 <a href=\"charge-engine-architecture-idempotency\">计费引擎架构：事件驱动的费用生成、幂等与重算机制</a> 里的不变式一致——冲销只是重算（true-up）在退款场景下的特例。</p>\n<p>对冲销分录而言，&quot;要不要退&quot;（冲销范围与费率）和&quot;退多少&quot;（基数按比例分摊）是两个独立问题：前者由平台费用政策决定，后者是纯计算问题，也是本文重点。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msubsup><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C = - \\sum_{i \\in R} b_i \\cdot r_i \\cdot \\frac{q_i^{\\text{ref}}}{q_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4065em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是被退款的订单行集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行的计费基数（成交价），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是匹配到的费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i^{\\text{ref}} / q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1078em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是退款数量占该行原始数量的比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲销范围-哪些费用该退-哪些必须保留\">冲销范围：哪些费用该退，哪些必须保留</h2><p>平台政策的第一条分界线是<strong>退款是否伴随实物退货</strong>。以 Amazon 公开政策为例：买家退货或卖家全额退款时，Amazon 退还推荐费（referral fee），但扣除一笔<strong>退款管理费</strong>（refund administration fee），费额为&quot;推荐费的 20% 与 5 美元中的较小者&quot;（Amazon Seller Central 帮助页 G200336920）。而当卖家&quot;仅退款不收货&quot;（refund without return）时，推荐费通常不予退还——因为商品成交事实并未被撤销。这直接影响判费逻辑：<strong>冲销触发条件必须携带 <code>return_received</code> 标志</strong>，不能只看退款金额。</p>\n<p>第二条分界线是<strong>费用的发生时点是否已不可逆</strong>。履约费（FBA fulfillment fee）在出库时已消耗仓内作业成本，退货入库不退；退货本身还会产生一笔<strong>退货处理费</strong>（return processing fee，适用部分类目/尺码）。因此每类费用需要一个&quot;可冲销性&quot;（reversibility）标记：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费用类目</th>\n<th>典型冲销行为</th>\n<th>冲销时点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成交佣金 / 推荐费</td>\n<td>全额退款时冲销，扣除退款管理费</td>\n<td>退款确认（含退货入库）</td>\n<td>仅退款不收货时通常不冲销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付处理费</td>\n<td>通常<strong>不冲销</strong></td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>Stripe 退款文档（docs.stripe.com/refunds）与 PayPal 商户费率页均说明原始处理费不因退款返还</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约费 / 出库费</td>\n<td>不冲销</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>已消耗的仓储与人力成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货处理费</td>\n<td><strong>新增</strong>正向分录（不是冲销）</td>\n<td>退货入库确认</td>\n<td>金额取决于类目与买家是否改变主意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费（买家支付）</td>\n<td>随商品同比例冲销</td>\n<td>退款确认</td>\n<td>若运费按订单级计价，需按行分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推广/广告扣费</td>\n<td>通常不冲销</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>点击已发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境增值税 / 销售税</td>\n<td>冲销或生成贷记单（credit note）</td>\n<td>退款确认</td>\n<td>需符合当地税法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>支付处理费因此是平台/卖家的<strong>沉没成本</strong>：引擎不应为它生成冲销分录，但应在报表里单独统计其占退款额的比重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按比例分摊-部分退款时基数的重算\">按比例分摊：部分退款时基数的重算</h2><p>部分退款有三种典型形态，分摊算法各不相同。</p>\n<p><strong>按行部分退。</strong> 客户买了 3 件 A（单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>）与</mtext><mn>1</mn><mtext>件</mtext><mi>B</mi><mtext>（单价</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20）与 1 件 B（单价</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）与</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（单价</span></span></span></span></span>50），退掉 1 件 A。若费率是 A 类目 15%、B 类目 8%，原始佣金为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 27: … \\times 0.15 + \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">20 \\times 3 \\times 0.15 + \\</span></span>50 \\times 0.08 = $13.00<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>，退款只涉及</mtext><mi>A</mi><mtext>行，冲销额为</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">，退款只涉及 A 行，冲销额为</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，退款只涉及</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">行，冲销额为</span></span></span></span></span>20 \\times 0.15 = $3.00<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>。</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>关键点：不能按</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>退款额</mtext><mo>÷</mo><mtext>订单总额</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>总佣金</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>计算</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>——那会把</mtext><mi>B</mi><mtext>行的佣金错误摊进来，得出</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">。**关键点：不能按&quot;退款额 ÷ 订单总额 × 总佣金&quot;计算**——那会把 B 行的佣金错误摊进来，得出</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">。</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">关键点：不能按</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退款额</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">÷</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">订单总额</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总佣金</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计算</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\">——</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">那会把</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">行的佣金错误摊进来，得出</span></span></span></span></span>13.00 \\times \\frac{20}{110}$ 这类被污染的结果。</p>\n<p><strong>金额部分退（协商折扣）。</strong> 平台按一个金额退款、没有明确退货行时，必须先做<strong>退款归集</strong>（refund attribution）：优先按退款明细携带的 <code>line_item_id</code> 归行，明细缺失时退化为按行成交价占比分摊并接受精度损失——这正是要在接入层要求&quot;退款必须带行标识&quot;的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>订单级费用的分摊。</strong> 运费、满减券、平台补贴是订单级金额，必须按权重下沉到行，否则单行退款的佣金基数不完整。三种权重在实践中都有人用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>分摊公式</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>失效场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按行成交价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = \\frac{p_i}{\\sum p_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2898em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通用、可解释</td>\n<td>高价低毛利商品承担过多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按数量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = \\frac{q_i}{\\sum q_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2898em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>同质商品（如整箱水）</td>\n<td>单价悬殊时严重失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按重量/体积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = \\frac{w_i}{\\sum w_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2538em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>履约费、跨境运费的归集</td>\n<td>需要商品主数据支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>高频陷阱是<strong>折扣的顺序</strong>：平台补贴券通常<strong>计入</strong>卖家佣金基数（卖家仍按原价承担佣金），卖家自设折扣则<strong>扣减</strong>基数，因此分摊前必须先按&quot;折扣来源&quot;分类再算，否则冲销额会系统性偏高或偏低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨期退-账期已关-账单已出-货款已结\">跨期退：账期已关、账单已出、货款已结</h2><p>退款不一定发生在当期。月末结账、出账单、打款之后才来的退款，会把冲销分录落在<strong>下一个账期</strong>。这带来三个必须在设计时回答的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，冲销落在哪一期？</strong> 会计原则是&quot;按退款事实发生的期间确认&quot;，但若对已结算账单做回溯修改，商家手上的对账单与银行到账金额就与系统不符，对账成本极高。主流做法是<strong>当期冲销 + 上期不回溯</strong>：冲销分录进当期，当期账单的&quot;调整项&quot;显式列出&quot;上期订单退款回收 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;并附原订单号。这既符合会计口径，又保证每张已发出的对账单永不改变，与 <a href=\"../billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/\">账期账单、调账与争议</a> 是同一条流水线。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，钱从哪里扣？</strong> 上一期已打款给商家，本期要把冲销额收回：直接从本期结算额抵扣（最常见）；不足时形成商家欠款（负余额）并<strong>结转下期</strong>；账户关闭或余额长期为负时进入催收或坏账核销。负余额必须作为独立科目管理，不能取零——否则商家关店前的最后一笔退款会永久悬空。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，跨境退款的汇率怎么定？</strong> 原订单以美元计价、以人民币结算，三个月后退款时汇率已变：<strong>原币冲销</strong>按原订单记账汇率冲销、差额进&quot;汇兑损益&quot;；<strong>现汇冲销</strong>按退款当日汇率重算，两者差异为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>orig</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>refund</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>orig</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = A_{\\text{orig}} \\cdot (e_{\\text{refund}} - e_{\\text{orig}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">orig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">refund</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">orig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。选哪种取决于合同约定，但<strong>必须写进对账单口径说明</strong>并全平台一致，否则同一商家在不同月份会看到无法解释的结算差异。IFRS 15 与 ASC 606 都把退款负债视为可变对价，要求每期重新估计，跨境场景下该估计必须含汇率假设。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[退款事件&lt;br/&gt;refund.issued] --&gt; B{是否伴随退货入库?}&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; C[仅记录退款&lt;br/&gt;佣金不冲销&lt;br/&gt;可选: 保留退款管理费]&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; D[退款归集&lt;br/&gt;按行标识或权重分摊]&#10;    D --&gt; E[逐费用类目判定可冲销性]&#10;    E --&gt; F[冲销分录&lt;br/&gt;negative amount]&#10;    F --&gt; G{原分录账期是否已关?}&#10;    G -- 否 --&gt; H[当期账单聚合]&#10;    G -- 是 --&gt; I[当期调整项&lt;br/&gt;上期退款回收]&#10;    I --&gt; J[抵扣本期结算&lt;br/&gt;不足则负余额结转]\">graph TD\n    A[退款事件&lt;br/&gt;refund.issued] --&gt; B{是否伴随退货入库?}\n    B -- 否 --&gt; C[仅记录退款&lt;br/&gt;佣金不冲销&lt;br/&gt;可选: 保留退款管理费]\n    B -- 是 --&gt; D[退款归集&lt;br/&gt;按行标识或权重分摊]\n    D --&gt; E[逐费用类目判定可冲销性]\n    E --&gt; F[冲销分录&lt;br/&gt;negative amount]\n    F --&gt; G{原分录账期是否已关?}\n    G -- 否 --&gt; H[当期账单聚合]\n    G -- 是 --&gt; I[当期调整项&lt;br/&gt;上期退款回收]\n    I --&gt; J[抵扣本期结算&lt;br/&gt;不足则负余额结转]</pre><h2 id=\"费用回收-平台替卖家垫付的退款怎么算回来\">费用回收：平台替卖家垫付的退款怎么算回来</h2><p>跨境电商的退款涉及平台、支付渠道、物流商三方，钱常由平台先垫付。费用回收（fee recovery）指平台把垫付或承担的部分，通过后续账期从卖家应收中收回。</p>\n<p><strong>退款管理费</strong>是卖家为&quot;平台处理退款&quot;支付的成本，Amazon 规则为推荐费的 20% 与 5 美元取小（帮助页 G200336920）。它的记账方式很关键：<strong>不是</strong>从原佣金里扣，而是作为一笔独立<strong>正向费用分录</strong>（类目 <code>refund_admin_fee</code>）打在退款发生的账期。若实现成&quot;原佣金冲销时少退一点&quot;，退款管理费就与佣金混在一个类目，商家无法单独统计退货管理成本。</p>\n<p><strong>退货物流标签费</strong>通常从卖家应收扣除，带强类目属性（大件、危险品更贵），应与履约费分开建模。<strong>跨境税费的回收</strong>依据欧盟增值税指令 2006/112/EC 第 90 条：交易被取消、退款或价款调整时计税基础相应减少，平台需生成贷记单（credit note）并在申报期做负向调整；美国销售税按各州规则对应&quot;已收税款的退还&quot;。**工程含义：税费冲销必须携带 <code>original_tax_entry_id</code>，否则税务申报时无法正确抵消。**<strong>促销补贴的追回</strong>常被与佣金冲销混淆——补贴是平台给卖家的钱（正向），追回是卖家的负债（负向），必须用不同科目。</p>\n<p>成熟实现给每条分录打 <code>recoverable</code> 与 <code>recovered_in_cycle</code> 两个字段，报账时按账龄分桶即可生成商家欠款账龄表，与 <a href=\"../settlement-reconciliation-reporting/\">对账结算、报表与合规</a> 对接；账龄超阈值时结算系统应触发自动抵扣或授信冻结。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界情况与工程校验\">边界情况与工程校验</h2><p><strong>重复退款与多次部分退。</strong> 同一订单可能先部分退、再全额退。若第一次冲销 1 件、第二次按&quot;全额&quot;冲销 3 件，就多冲一笔。解法是<strong>以累计口径计算</strong>：每次退款后重算该订单行的&quot;累计应冲销额&quot;，与&quot;累计已冲销额&quot;相减得本次增量——这与 <a href=\"charge-engine-architecture-idempotency\">计费引擎架构：事件驱动的费用生成、幂等与重算机制</a> 中&quot;追加差额分录&quot;一致，天然对重复事件免疫。</p>\n<p><strong>取整的残余。</strong> 按比例分摊后各行冲销额之和可能与退款总额差几分钱，必须指定一个<strong>承担残余的行</strong>（通常是金额最大的行）补差，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\Delta C_i = \\Delta C_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。取整逻辑集中在 <a href=\"../charge-basis-rate-card-engine/\">费率卡与取整</a> 模块供退款模块复用，避免两处实现漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>可用的自检不变式。</strong> 上线前值得固化为回归测试的三条等式：全额退款 + 退货入库后佣金冲销额与退款管理费之和应等于原佣金；任意订单的累计冲销额不得超过其累计计提费用；冲销分录的 <code>reverses_entry_id</code> 必须指向真实存在且币种一致的原分录。第二条被违反通常是分摊权重或折扣顺序配置错误——最值得告警的一类数据质量信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>退款是<strong>追加反向分录</strong>（<code>reverses_entry_id</code> 指向原分录），不是删除原分录——审计轨迹、对账一致性与分录求和不变式都依赖这一点。</li>\n<li>冲销范围由政策与&quot;事实是否可逆&quot;共同决定：佣金/推荐费在退货入库后可冲销并扣退款管理费；支付处理费、履约费、广告费通常不冲销；退货处理费是<strong>新增正向费用</strong>而非冲销。</li>\n<li>部分退款先按行做退款归集再乘费率，<strong>严禁</strong>用&quot;退款额 ÷ 订单总额 × 总佣金&quot;的整体比例法；订单级金额按成交价/数量/重量权重下沉，折扣按&quot;平台补贴 vs 卖家折扣&quot;分类。</li>\n<li>跨期退采用&quot;当期冲销、上期不回溯&quot;，通过当期调整项回收上期已结款项，不足形成负余额结转；跨境退款须明确原币/现汇汇率口径，并符合 IFRS 15 / ASC 606 的可变对价估计要求。</li>\n<li>费用回收用独立科目并打 <code>recoverable</code> / <code>recovered_in_cycle</code> 标记；多次退款以&quot;累计应冲销 − 累计已冲销&quot;算增量，取整残余由指定行承担，用三条不变式做回归自检。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退款退货的费用冲销与按比例分摊：部分退、跨期退与费用回收","id":"退款退货的费用冲销与按比例分摊-部分退-跨期退与费用回收"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：退款是「记一笔反向分录」，不是「删一笔费用」","id":"核心概念-退款是-记一笔反向分录-不是-删一笔费用"},{"level":2,"text":"冲销范围：哪些费用该退，哪些必须保留","id":"冲销范围-哪些费用该退-哪些必须保留"},{"level":2,"text":"按比例分摊：部分退款时基数的重算","id":"按比例分摊-部分退款时基数的重算"},{"level":2,"text":"跨期退：账期已关、账单已出、货款已结","id":"跨期退-账期已关-账单已出-货款已结"},{"level":2,"text":"费用回收：平台替卖家垫付的退款怎么算回来","id":"费用回收-平台替卖家垫付的退款怎么算回来"},{"level":2,"text":"边界情况与工程校验","id":"边界情况与工程校验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"订单费用项计算：佣金、履约、仓储、广告与订阅费的计费方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/fee-calculation-charge-engine/order-fee-item-computation"},"next":{"title":"账期与账单生成：结算周期、账单结构与冻结/出账时点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/billing-cycle-statement-generation"}}